** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is an elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis and $a=\\frac{1}{2},\\,c=1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381343 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381344 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381345 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381346 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186381347 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186381344 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381342 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "43c8dfda-6cef-5087-93b4-33239a4ddcbe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381343 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381343 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381343 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "67c1753a-2ec8-57b6-90b2-f3e9290c36f0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381344 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381344 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381344 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e59d0521-9453-5d23-9d0b-63fc30e4b04c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381345 #edb/ref 1080 "A parabolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381345 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381345 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7adf68e0-97af-59e9-8764-045285768c7e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381346 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone whose axis of symmetry is the $y$-axis" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186381346 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #