 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $y$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+5{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}-2x+20y+11 & =0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}-2x)+5({y}^{2}+4y)+{z}^{2}+11 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}-1+5([y+2)^{2}-4]+{z}^{2}+11 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}-1+5(y+2)^{2}-20+{z}^{2}+11 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+5(y+2)^{2}+{z}^{2}-10 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-1)^{2}+5(y+2)^{2}+{z}^{2}-10 & =0 \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+5(y+2)^{2}+{z}^{2} & =10 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{10}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{10} & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an ellipsoid centered at $(1,-2,0).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401553 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401554 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401556 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401557 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401553 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401552 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f0d3a90f-543b-5602-bf42-4796008282b3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401553 #edb/ref 1080 "An ellipsoid centered at $(1,-2,0)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401553 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401553 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ff8dd7e4-d04f-54e0-9c82-7503faa98408" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401554 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone centered at $(1,-2,0)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401554 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401554 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6ee2009b-db2c-5ad5-a30f-47e82534faf3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401555 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone centered at $(1,2,1)$" #edb/r